{"id": "66265", "title": "独宠小娇妻", "author": "中街冰点", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 18, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/66/66265.htm", "intro": "他，史上最年轻的市长。爷爷是高级司令官，父母是商界龙头之主，兄弟更是驰骋黑道的枭雄。他是政坛之上的天之骄子，也是黑道幕后之主。他手握政商半边天，有数不尽的女人为他趋之若鹜。然而，他却独宠上一只平凡无奇的‘小野猫’。他说：天大地大老婆最大。他说：我不要掌握别人的命运，我只要你今后的人生。\r\n\r\n[宠溺片段]：某高层领 导会上，助理急急忙忙跑进来：“市长，夫人把厨房炸了。” “炸就炸吧！只要保护夫人不要受伤。” “市长，安全中心防护系统被夫人玩崩溃。” “崩溃就崩溃，找人修好，让夫人继续玩。” \r\n\r\n【宠文：她萌萌可爱又古灵精怪，他风度翩翩又腹黑强霸，当她遇见他，到底谁先被吃掉？】", "base": "files/article/html/66/66265", "chapters": [{"title": "1-8", "file": "9957035.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9-18", "file": "9957036.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19-30", "file": "9957037.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-41", "file": "9957038.html", "available": false}, {"title": "42-55", "file": "9957039.html", "available": false}, {"title": "56-70", "file": "9957040.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-83", "file": "9957041.html", "available": false}, {"title": "84-89", "file": "9957042.html", "available": false}, {"title": "90-95", "file": "9957043.html", "available": false}, {"title": "96-102", "file": "9957044.html", "available": false}, {"title": "103-108", "file": "9957045.html", "available": false}, {"title": "109-114", "file": "9957046.html", "available": false}, {"title": "115-121", "file": "9957047.html", "available": false}, {"title": "122-128", "file": "9957048.html", "available": false}, {"title": "129-135", "file": "9957049.html", "available": false}, {"title": "136-141", "file": "9957050.html", "available": false}, {"title": "142-144", "file": "9957051.html", "available": false}, {"title": "145-147完结", "file": "9957052.html", "available": false}]}